#~ "audio books when a jukebox track is currently playing, instead of "
#~ "silently treating the jukebox track as a station.\n"
#~ "- The Station Browser now contains eight tabs instead of seven; tab "
#~ "navigation shortcuts run from Alt+1 through Alt+8.\n"
#~ "- Ctrl+Tab / Ctrl+Shift+Tab tab cycling now includes the Jukebox tab.\n"
#~ "- Ctrl+Win+I (What's playing) now also announces jukebox track names.\n"
#~ "- Ctrl+Win+J and Ctrl+Win+K (tiered seek) now also work on jukebox "
#~ "tracks.\n"
#~ "- Ctrl+Win+T (Toggle time-shift buffer) now clarifies that it has no "
#~ "effect on podcast, audio book, or jukebox playback.\n"
